{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 31, :comments ["<b>Madmenah.</b> The heights — it is a place name, or pits, from the Aramaic translation." "<b>He gathered.</b> They fled for their lives, or others of Israel, for it is a transitive verb [like] 'gather your livestock' <small>(Exodus 9:19)</small>."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:53:19.577928881Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}